        <deprecated>false</deprecated>
        <description>The link in this field opens an app or a record from where an action can be performed. For example, Automated Eliminations tab, Currency Revaluation Criteria tab, and more. You can display App Location 1 to 5 fields. By default, App Location 1 and 2 fields are visible.</description>
